    "en": "# VoiceTecx Privacy Policy\n\nEffective [TO FILL: date] · TECXMATE COMPANY LIMITED ([TO FILL: registered address]; tax ID [TO FILL])\n\nVoiceTecx turns speech into text **on your Mac**. This page says exactly what the app and our shop do with your data.\n\n## 1. Your voice and text stay on your Mac\n\n- Speech is recognised by models running on your Mac. Audio is sent only to VoiceTecx's own engines on the same Mac\n  (never through a proxy) and is **never sent to us or anyone else**.\n- **Recordings are not kept.** The audio of a dictation is discarded once it is turned into text.\n- **History** (the text of each dictation, the app it went into and the time) is stored only on your Mac, in a file\n  only your user account can read, for as long as you choose in Settings (default 30 days). You can delete it at any\n  time.\n- **Clipboard history** (if you turn it on) keeps your last 30 copied items on your Mac; items that password managers\n  mark as concealed are never kept.\n- 常用詞 (vocabulary), corrections and settings stay on your Mac.\n- **No account, no analytics, no advertising, no crash reporting.** VoiceTecx does not track how you use it.\n\n## 2. When the app connects to the internet\n\nOnly in these cases:\n1. **Downloading a language** when you click Download: from huggingface.co (Hugging Face, Inc.). Every file is checked\n   against a fingerprint built into the app.\n2. **Checking for updates** (Sparkle), only after the app has asked you whether to check automatically, or when you\n   choose 檢查更新⋯ / Check for Updates. No system profile is sent.\n3. **購買授權⋯ / Buy a Licence** opens our website in your browser; **回報問題 / Report a Problem** opens a draft in\n   your own mail app, which you can read and edit, and nothing is sent until you send it.\n\nFor 1 and 2, as with any download, Hugging Face receives your IP address and the app's name and version in the\nrequest. We do not receive or combine this information.\n\n## 3. Your licence\n\nA licence key contains the **name and email address** you gave when buying, the plan, the number of seats and the\nversion it covers. It is checked on your Mac with no connection to us and is stored only on your Mac.\n\n## 4. When you buy\n\n- **In Taiwan** payment is processed by **ECPay** (綠界科技), which also issues the electronic uniform invoice\n  (電子發票). **Outside Taiwan** our reseller **Paddle** (Paddle.com Market Ltd) is the merchant of record and processes\n  payment and tax. We never see or store your full card number.\n- We keep: your name, email, order number, plan, the licence key issued, and the invoice records the law requires.\n- Purposes: delivering and supporting your licence, refunds, invoicing and accounting, and answering your messages.\n- Retention: for as long as your licence is supported, and invoices and accounting records for the period Taiwan's\n  tax law requires.\n- We do not sell or share your data, except with ECPay or Paddle to process the payment, and with authorities\n  where the law requires.\n\n## 5. Your rights\n\nUnder Taiwan's Personal Data Protection Act (個人資料保護法) you may ask to see, copy, correct, or delete your data, or\nask us to stop using it, except where the law requires us to keep it. If you do not give a name and email, we cannot\nissue a licence. Write to **support@tecxmate.com**.\n\n## 6. Changes\n\nIf the app's handling of data changes, we will update this page before that version is released, and note the\nchange in the release notes.\n\nContact: support@tecxmate.com\n",
    "zh": "# VoiceTecx 隱私權政策\n\n生效日期：［待填］・［待填：公司登記中文名稱］（TECXMATE COMPANY LIMITED，統一編號［待填］，地址［待填］）\n\nVoiceTecx 在**您的 Mac 上**把語音轉成文字。本頁說明 App 與我們的商店如何處理您的資料，內容與 App 實際行為一致。\n\n## 一、語音與文字留在您的 Mac\n\n- 語音由在您 Mac 上執行的模型辨識。錄音只送到同一台 Mac 上 VoiceTecx 自己的引擎（不經任何代理伺服器），\n  **不會傳給我們或任何人**。\n- **不保留錄音**。每次聽寫的聲音轉成文字後即刪除。\n- **歷史紀錄**（每次聽寫的文字、輸入到哪個 App、時間）只存在您的 Mac，檔案僅您的使用者帳號可讀，保留天數由您在\n  設定中決定（預設 30 天），可隨時刪除。\n- **剪貼簿紀錄**（若您開啟）在您的 Mac 保留最近 30 筆；密碼管理工具標記為隱藏的內容一律不記錄。\n- 常用詞、修正規則與設定都留在您的 Mac。\n- **不需帳號，沒有使用分析、廣告或當機回報**。VoiceTecx 不追蹤您的使用情形。\n\n## 二、App 何時連上網路\n\n只有以下情況：\n1. **下載語言包**（您按下「下載」時）：從 huggingface.co（Hugging Face, Inc.）下載。每個檔案都會與 App 內建的\n   指紋比對。\n2. **檢查更新**（Sparkle）：App 先詢問您是否自動檢查，或您點選「檢查更新⋯」時。不傳送系統資訊。\n3. 「**購買授權⋯**」在瀏覽器開啟我們的網站；「**回報問題**」在您自己的郵件 App 開啟一封草稿，您可以閱讀與修改，\n   您按下傳送前不會寄出任何內容。\n\n第 1、2 項如同任何下載，Hugging Face 會收到您的 IP 位址以及 App 的名稱與版本。我們不會收到或彙整這些資訊。\n\n## 三、您的授權\n\n授權碼包含您購買時提供的**姓名與電子郵件**、方案、席次與適用版本。授權碼在您的 Mac 上驗證，不連線到我們，\n也只存在您的 Mac。\n\n## 四、購買時\n\n- **在台灣**由**綠界科技（ECPay**）處理付款並開立電子發票；**在台灣以外**由經銷商 **Paddle**（Paddle.com Market\n  Ltd）擔任交易的賣方，處理付款與稅務。我們不會看到或儲存您的完整卡號。\n- 我們保存：姓名、電子郵件、訂單編號、方案、核發的授權碼，以及法律要求的發票紀錄。\n- 蒐集目的：提供與支援您的授權、退款、開立發票與會計，以及回覆您的來信。\n- 保存期間：在您的授權受支援期間；發票與會計紀錄依稅法規定的期間保存。\n- 除交由綠界或 Paddle 處理付款，以及依法提供主管機關外，我們不出售或分享您的資料。\n\n## 五、您的權利\n\n依《個人資料保護法》，您可以請求查詢、閱覽、製給複製本、補充或更正、停止蒐集處理利用或刪除您的個人資料，\n但法律要求保存者除外。若您不提供姓名與電子郵件，我們將無法核發授權。請來信 **support@tecxmate.com**。\n\n## 六、變更\n\n若 App 處理資料的方式改變，我們會在該版本發布前更新本頁，並在版本說明中註明。\n\n聯絡我們：support@tecxmate.com\n"
