    "en": "# VoiceTecx Refund Policy\n\nEffective [TO FILL: date] · TECXMATE COMPANY LIMITED\n\n**14 days, no questions asked.** If VoiceTecx is not right for you, write to **support@tecxmate.com** within 14 days\nof buying, with your order number or the email you bought with. You get a full refund.\n\n- **Paid in Taiwan (ECPay):** refunded to the same card or account; the electronic invoice is voided or a credit\n  note issued. Banks usually take 7–14 working days to show it.\n- **Paid outside Taiwan (Paddle):** Paddle refunds the payment as the merchant of record.\n- After a refund the licence key is no longer valid; please remove it in Settings › 授權. Free use continues.\n- Business licences: refunds per unused seat within 14 days; after 14 days, talk to us.\n- After 14 days we do not normally refund, but if something does not work as described, write to us.\n\nThis policy adds to your rights under Taiwan's Consumer Protection Act and does not replace them. [TO CONFIRM by our\nlawyer or accountant: as digital content delivered online, VoiceTecx may be excluded from the 7-day cancellation\nright only if you agreed to this before buying; our 14-day refund is more generous in any case.]\n",
